{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42314","headline":"以端谿砚酬张员外水精珠兼和来篇 · 徐铉","name":"以端谿砚酬张员外水精珠兼和来篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"请以端谿润，酬君水玉明。\n方圆虽异器，功用信俱呈。\n自得山川秀，能分日月精。\n巾箱各珍重，所贵在交情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}